      "body": "## Overview\n\n`test_plan_uses_state_params` calls `_SM90State.plan()`, which calls `torch.cuda.is_current_stream_capturing()`. On CPU-only torch builds this raises `RuntimeError: Tried to instantiate dummy base class _cuda_isCurrentStreamCapturing`. Patch it to return False in the test, as other tests in the repo already do.\n\n## Test Plan\n`pytest -q tests/v1/attention/test_flashinfer_mla_sparse_sm90.py`\n\n## Test Result\nPass on a CPU-only build, where `test_plan_uses_state_params[kv_dtype0/1]` previously failed.\n\n\n",
